+# Draft delegation host fixture
+
+`host-next` is an unpublished, unreviewed snapshot of the host runtime files
+needed by the draft provider tests. `host-next.unreviewed.json` records the host
+base commit and each copied file's SHA-256 and Git blob hash. The source was a
+working tree, so those hashes do not identify a committed or released host.
+The verifier checks the complete fixture on every standalone test run and fails
+on changed, missing, extra or non-regular files; it never updates the manifest.
+
+The snapshot exercises real host runtime contracts, with the provider's normal
+test shims for unrelated Nuxt services. It does not replace the explicit
+real-host, packed-artifact, or release qualification lanes. Before release,
+review the final host changes, replace this draft with a snapshot of a committed
+candidate, update provenance, and qualify the standalone and matching live-host
+lanes. `OR3_PROJECT_HOST_ROOT` selects live host sources for draft integration
+tests; it is not evidence that the host or provider is released.
